# The showcase tour: viewpoints across K1 and TSL, rendered headless into a
# contact sheet and compared with the previous run (`kjk tour tours/showcase.tour`).
#
# One stop per line:
#   <name> <game> <module> entry [yaw offset] [pitch] [fov]
#   <name> <game> <module> at <x> <y> <z> <yaw> <pitch> [fov]
# `entry` stands at the module's entry point, eye height 1.7 m, facing the
# entry direction turned by the yaw offset (degrees). Pitch and fov default
# to -5 and 75 (reone's first-person camera). Coordinates are game space.

# K1
endar_quarters      k1  end_m01aa   entry
endar_windows       k1  end_m01aa   at 15.7 22.2 0.47 180 5
endar_corridor      k1  end_m01aa   at 46.6 30 0.47 90 0
taris_upper         k1  tar_m02aa   entry
taris_lower         k1  tar_m05aa   entry
dantooine_enclave   k1  danm13      entry
dantooine_courtyard k1  danm14aa    entry
tatooine_anchorhead k1  tat_m17aa   entry
kashyyyk_walkway    k1  kas_m22aa   entry
manaan_ahto         k1  manm26aa    entry
korriban_dreshdae   k1  korr_m33aa  entry
unknown_beach       k1  unk_m41aa   entry
ebon_hawk           k1  ebo_m12aa   entry

# TSL
ebon_hawk_prologue  tsl 001ebo      entry
